{"ID":"20240205153659-wxkfncg","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153659-wxkfncg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153659-wxkfncg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091646-to9vmbi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205163458-o722asm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091646-to9vmbi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:189,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:189\u0026#125;","title":"三棱（三菱）","type":"doc","updated":"20240709101923"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206091646-to9vmbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091646-to9vmbi","updated":"20240206091651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于江苏、河南、山东、江西、辽宁等地。\n【性状】\t干燥块茎呈圆锥形或扁卵圆形，上圆下尖，长2.55cm，直径1.53.5cm；表面黄白色或灰黄色，细腻或粗糙不平，有刀削痕迹，并有密集的点状须根痕，略呈横向环状排列，两侧面有突起，凹凸不平；质坚实，极难折断，入水下沉。切断面平坦，黄白色或灰白色，向内色较深，中间有多数不明显的维管束小点；气微弱，味淡，嚼之微有麻辣感。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，性平。\n【功效】\t破血行气，消积止痛。适用于多种肿瘤，以及血瘀气滞、腹部结块、肝脾肿大、经闭腹痛、食积胀痛等。\n【炙品】\t醋三棱：取净三棱片，照醋炙法炒至色变深。每100Kg三棱，用醋15kg。呈圆锥形，略扁，长26cm，直径24cm。表面黄白色或灰黄色，有刀削痕，须根痕小点状，略呈横向环状排列。断面褐色，体重，质坚。"}]},{"ID":"20240206091641-uc6z72e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091641-uc6z72e","updated":"20240206091641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206091641-rs4bek8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163453-w3dvmsu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163453-w3dvmsu","updated":"20240205163455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三棱"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三棱-20240205163453-ch58feb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163458-o722asm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163458-o722asm","updated":"20240205163458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三棱切面"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三棱切面-20240205163455-d258pp9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709095734-3ia9bv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709095734-3ia9bv6","updated":"20240709095857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 364px;","style":"width: 354px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三棱2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三棱2-20240709095734-tat3e05.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 354px;\" parent-style=\"width: 364px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 449px;","style":"width: 439px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三棱1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三棱1-20240709095854-fw6eflc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 439px;\" parent-style=\"width: 449px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709095657-4dhxnsa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709095657-4dhxnsa","updated":"20240709102022"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 438px;","style":"width: 428px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三棱"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三棱-20240709095657-qsx74ad.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 428px;\" parent-style=\"width: 438px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 792px;","style":"width: 782px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"荆三棱5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/荆三棱5-20240709102022-4mw3k76.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 782px;\" parent-style=\"width: 792px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709101827-nx2nyft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709101827-nx2nyft","updated":"20240709101827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 620px;","style":"width: 610px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三棱4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三棱4-20240709101302-ld0vkbg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 610px;\" parent-style=\"width: 620px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 521px;","style":"width: 511px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三棱3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三棱3-20240709101208-rghexrz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 511px;\" parent-style=\"width: 521px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709101852-az1xfyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709101852-az1xfyg","updated":"20240709101923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 622px;","style":"width: 612px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240709101852-vnnh72h.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 612px;\" parent-style=\"width: 622px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 527px;","style":"width: 517px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240709101914-xndc3c8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 517px;\" parent-style=\"width: 527px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709101809-twq6g1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709101809-twq6g1q","updated":"20240709101809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"三棱6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/三棱6-20240709101809-x1fdldp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830103145-3x9syzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103145-3x9syzg","updated":"20240830103145"}},{"ID":"20240709102307-2ryu3ag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709102307-2ryu3ag","updated":"20240709102313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黑三棱"}]},{"ID":"20240709102340-c3r7rh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709102340-c3r7rh6","updated":"20240709102340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 384px;","style":"width: 374px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黑三棱1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黑三棱1-20240709102340-051vtgo.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 374px;\" parent-style=\"width: 384px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709102435-2d0datq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709102435-2d0datq","updated":"20240709105227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 607px;","style":"width: 597px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黑三棱2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黑三棱2-20240709102435-pnufvld.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 597px;\" parent-style=\"width: 607px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 609px;","style":"width: 599px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黑三棱3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黑三棱3-20240709102539-tbrnwf2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 599px;\" parent-style=\"width: 609px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709102604-8ahm5ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709102604-8ahm5ck","updated":"20240709104629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 607px;","style":"width: 597px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黑三棱4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黑三棱4-20240709102604-3yko3fs.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 597px;\" parent-style=\"width: 607px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 588px;","style":"width: 578px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黑三棱5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黑三棱5-20240709104627-cd1bo6b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 578px;\" parent-style=\"width: 588px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709104845-viyu8xr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240709104845-viyu8xr","updated":"20240709105114"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 380px;","style":"width: 370px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黑三棱6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黑三棱6-20240709104845-3o5hhbh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 370px;\" parent-style=\"width: 380px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 845px;","style":"width: 835px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黑三棱8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黑三棱8-20240709105112-pmk452q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 835px;\" parent-style=\"width: 845px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240709100109-0o9p84j","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240709100109-0o9p84j"}},{"ID":"20240830103112-7n9973r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-7n9973r","updated":"20240830103141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：三棱"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-izuotvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-izuotvj","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三棱《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-5s47qn4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-5s47qn4","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】SānLénɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-jeh6wih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-jeh6wih","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】黑三棱"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-vlic3gb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-vlic3gb","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为黑三棱科植物黑三棱SparganiumstoloniferumBuch.-Ham.的干燥块茎。冬季至次年春采挖，洗净，削去外皮，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-wb8n1rn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-wb8n1rn","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本，高60～100厘米，植株质地疏松呈海绵质，绿色。根状茎圆柱形，横走于泥中，下生粗短的块茎及多数须根，茎直立，圆柱形。叶丛生，排成2列，长条形，长60～95厘米，宽8～14毫米，先端钝，全缘，中脉在下面突出成棱，基部鞘状，三棱形，抱茎。6～7月间从叶丛间生出花萼，不分枝或分枝，具叶状苞片，花单性，雌雄同株，花密集成圆头状，排成疏离穗状花序，雄花在上，雌花在下；花被3～4片，雄花具有3雄蕊，雌花具单心皮雌蕊，或少为2个离生的单雌蕊。果为核果状，具棱角。分布于东北、黄河流域、长江中下游各省区及西藏。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-rba8m14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-rba8m14","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品呈圆锥形，略扁，长2～6cm，直径2～4cm。表面黄白色或灰黄色，有刀削痕，须根痕小点状，略呈横向环状排列。体重，质坚实。无臭，味淡，嚼之微有麻辣感。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-qbdmobb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-qbdmobb","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】本品横切面：皮层为通气组织，薄壁细胞分枝状，枝端彼此相连，形成大的细胞间隙；内皮层细胞排列紧密。中柱薄壁细胞类圆形，壁略厚，内含淀粉粒；维管束外韧型及周木型，散列，导管非木化。皮层及中柱均散有分泌细胞，内含棕红色分泌物。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-0y61b5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-0y61b5h","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-fs9nuwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-fs9nuwa","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三棱：除去杂质，浸泡，润透，切薄片，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-zd617yi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-zd617yi","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"醋三棱：取净三棱片，照醋炙法（附录ⅡD）炒至色变深。每100Kg三棱，用醋15kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-if1arhl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-if1arhl","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛、苦，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-1y1hrwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-1y1hrwc","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肝、脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-2oaynl1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-2oaynl1","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】破血行气，消积止痛。用于症瘕痞块，瘀血经闭，食积胀痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-irwejwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-irwejwq","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】4.5～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-yeucndc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-yeucndc","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】孕妇禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-wl2sh51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-wl2sh51","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-xbxvc6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-xbxvc6z","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】（1）同属植物的块茎作三棱入药的还有：1.细叶黑三棱：SparganiumstenophyllumMaxim.其特点在于根状茎短不横走，叶窄条形，宽2～3毫米，花穗无梗。2.小黑三棱：SparganiumsimplexHuds.特征为叶宽条形，扁平，宽5～8毫米，最下部花穗有梗。二者分布于黑龙江、吉林、辽宁及河北等省。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-wg08xrf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-wg08xrf","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-b7ntajm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-b7ntajm","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三棱《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-b0j579d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-b0j579d","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《本草拾遗》"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-wm93nk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-wm93nk0","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】SānLénɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-dl587vl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-dl587vl","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】萆根（《抱朴子》），京三棱（《开宝本草》），红蒲根（《本草图经》），光三棱（《药材资料汇编》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-17acnyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-17acnyb","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为黑三棱科植物黑三棱或小黑三棱、细叶黑三棱的块茎。秋、冬二季均可采收，挖取块茎后，去掉茎叶及须根，洗净，削去外皮，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-a6hmum1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-a6hmum1","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-dlavojt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-dlavojt","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①黑三棱（《救荒本草》），又名：肄草（《字林》），三棱草（《千金翼方》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-0luns5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-0luns5i","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生草本。根茎横走，下生粗而短的块茎。茎直立，圆柱形，光滑，高50～100厘米。叶丛生，2列；叶片线形，长60～95厘米，宽约2厘米，叶背具1条纵棱，先端钝尖，基部抱茎。花茎由叶丛抽出，单一，有时分枝；花单性，集成头状花序，有叶状苞片；雄花序位于雌花序的上部，直径约10毫米，通常2～10个；雌花序直径12毫米以上，通常1～3个；雄花花被3～4，倒披针形；雄蕊3；雌花有雌，蕊1，罕为2，子房纺锤形，柱头长3～4毫米，丝状。果呈核果状，倒卵状圆锥形，长6～10毫米，径4～8毫米，先端有锐尖头，花被宿存。花期6～7月。果期7～8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-ujnjrmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-ujnjrmd","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于池沼或水沟等处。分布黑龙江、吉林、辽宁、河北、河南、安徽、江苏、浙江、江西、湖南、湖北、四川、山西、陕西、甘肃、宁夏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-olsk9rw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-olsk9rw","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②小黑三棱"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-8j5r67u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-8j5r67u","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生草本。根茎短，生多数块茎。茎高40～60厘米，叶片宽线形，长45～55厘米；宽6～8毫米。雄花序位于雌，花序之上，无柄，通常5～7个，具叶状苞片；雌花序3～6个；雄花花药线形，花丝线状；雌花子房倒卵形，花柱宿存，略呈钩状。果呈核果状；纺锤形，熟时黑褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-2rlzpua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-2rlzpua","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于池沼及水沟等处。分布黑龙江、吉林、辽宁、河北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-0fxbxwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-0fxbxwk","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③细叶黑三棱"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-zz6gnx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-zz6gnx4","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"形态特点为根茎短，块茎较小；叶片狭线形，长45～70厘米，宽3～4毫米。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-fm8pyk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-fm8pyk3","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于沼泽、水沟等处；分布东北、河北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-3e3uud3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-3e3uud3","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】主产江苏、河南、山东、讧西。辽宁、安徽、浙江、四川、湖北等地亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-8njsfgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-8njsfgs","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥块茎呈圆锥形：扁卵圆形，上圆下尖，长2.5～5厘米，直径1.5～3.5厘米。表面黄白色或灰黄色，细腻或粗糙不平，有刀削痕迹，并有密集的点状须根痕，略呈横向环状排列，两侧面有突起，凹凸不平。质坚实，极难折断。切断面平坦，黄白色或灰白色，向内色较深，中间有多数不明显的维管束小点。气微弱，味淡，嚼之微有麻辣感。以个匀、体重、质坚实、去净外皮、表面黄白色者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-wl2i4v2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-wl2i4v2","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】小黑三棱含挥发油0.05％。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-y6bvmvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-y6bvmvm","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】三棱：拣净杂质，用水浸泡，捞出润透，切片，晒干。醋三棱：取净三棱置开水锅内浸没，煮至五、六成透时，加醋再煮至八成透，停止加水，并停止续火，留在锅内闷透，吸尽余汤，捞出，晾至外皮无水分，切片，晒干。（每三棱100斤，用醋30斤）"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-dt9h2f2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-dt9h2f2","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-uurs7vl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-uurs7vl","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦辛，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-4dgwi9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-4dgwi9i","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草拾遗》：\"甘平，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-kcllf9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-kcllf9v","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《日华子本草》：\"味甘涩，凉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-yzbwnop","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-yzbwnop","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《开宝本草》：\"味苦，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-664amlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-664amlm","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草衍义补遗》：\"辛苦。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-b8y8cy5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-b8y8cy5","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-x711vrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-x711vrt","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肝。脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-imncdq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-imncdq7","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入肺、脾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-li4pt4m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-li4pt4m","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"入足厥阴、太阴。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-e1igojq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-e1igojq","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-ggxcphq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-ggxcphq","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"破血，行气，消积，止痛。治症瘕积聚，气血凝滞，心腹疼痛，胁下胀疼，经闭，产后瘀血腹痛，跌打损伤。疮肿坚硬。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-zk0kzzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-zk0kzzg","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《日华子本草》：\"治妇人血脉不调，心腹痛，落胎，消恶血，补劳，通月经，治气胀，消扑损瘀血，产后腹痛、血运并宿血不下。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-pm51cgx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-pm51cgx","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《开宝本草》：\"主老癖症瘕结块。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-5hzjd8u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-5hzjd8u","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《医学启源》：\"主心膈痛，饮食不消，破气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-xhssujv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-xhssujv","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④王好古：\"通肝经积血。治疮肿坚硬。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-wvuf7d4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-wvuf7d4","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-w06c1gr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-w06c1gr","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-5qvn0c8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-5qvn0c8","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气虚体弱，血枯经闭及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-hmjzs8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-hmjzs8z","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《医学启源》：\"破气损真，气虚人不用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-kc19txe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-kc19txe","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《品汇精要》：\"妊娠不可服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-un97yg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-un97yg8","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《得配本草》：\"素有血症者禁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-robf5uw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-robf5uw","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-wowe8jn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-wowe8jn","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治症瘕：三棱草（切）一石，以水五石，煮取一石，去渣，更煎取三斗，于铜器中重釜煎如稠糖，出，纳密器中，旦以酒一盏服一匕，日二服，每服常令酒气相续。（《千金翼方》三棱草煎）"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-a68tffq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-a68tffq","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治五积六聚，七症八瘕，破一切血，下一切气：大黄（煨）、硼砂、三棱（煨热，切）、干漆（炒烟尽）、巴豆（去皮、油）各一两。上为末，醋煮糊为丸，如绿豆大，每服三丸，或五丸、七丸，量人虚实加减服，空心米汤下。（《医学切问》三棱丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-nteh8e8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-nteh8e8","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治妇人、室女血寝，月经不通，脐下坚结大如杯，久而不治，必成血蛊：京三棱、蓬术各二两，芫花半两，青皮（去瓤净）一两半。上锉如豆大，用好醋一升，煮干，焙为细末，醋糊为丸，如桐于大，每服五十丸，食前用淡醋汤下。（《济生方》三棱煎丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-fpx3l3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-fpx3l3o","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治血瘀经闭，小膜痛：三棱三钱，当归三钱，红花一钱，五分，生地四钱。水煎服。（《新疆中草药手册》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-fdjjow1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-fdjjow1","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治产后癥块：京三棱一两（微煨，锉），木香半两，硇砂三分（细研），芫花半两（醋拌炒干），巴豆一分（去心、皮，纸裹压去油）。上药，捣罗为末，研入前件硇砂、巴豆令匀，以米醋二升，熬令减半，下诸药，慢火熬令稠可丸，即丸如绿豆大，每服，空心以醋汤下二丸。（《圣惠方》三棱丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-9po4tv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-9po4tv8","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治食积腹胀：三棱、莱菔子各三钱。水煎服。（《新疆中草药手册》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-0iaj2lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-0iaj2lf","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治慢性肝炎或迁延性肝炎：三棱、莪术、当归各三钱，赤芍四钱，丹参八钱，白茅根一两，青皮三钱。水煎服。（《新疆中草药手册》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-8zeuxy5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-8zeuxy5","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】此外，尚有莎草科植物荆三棱的块茎，在东北及内蒙古、陕西、新疆、江苏等地亦作三棱使用，商品习称\"黑三棱\"（《开宝本草》记载的黑三棱即此），或称\"带皮三棱\"。荆三棱为多年生草本，高70～150厘米。根茎横走，先端具球状块茎。茎锐三棱形。叶扁平，线形，长20～30厘米，宽5～10毫米，基部呈鞘状抱茎。长侧枝聚伞花序有3～8辐射枝；每辐射枝有1～3（～4）小穗；小穗长圆形，长1～2厘米，宽6～8（～10）毫米；鳞片膜质，长约7毫米，外面被短柔毛，先端有芒，芒长2～3毫米；刚毛6；雄蕊3，雌蕊1，柱头3。小坚果三棱形。药材呈近圆球形或倒圆锥形，长约3～4厘米，直径约2～3厘米。表面黑褐色或红棕色，有皱纹，须根痕较少；去皮者外形与上述品种相似；质轻而坚，横切面平坦，黄色，有散在的维管束；气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-0tlvt7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-0tlvt7g","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-339qd52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-339qd52","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三棱《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-ed8rnvp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-ed8rnvp","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《本草纲目拾遗》。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-evggw2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-evggw2b","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】SānLénɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-yk82ul0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-yk82ul0","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】CommonBurreedRhizome,RhizomeofCommonBurreed"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-bz1f19g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-bz1f19g","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】京三棱、红蒲根、光三棱、"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-qyt8byl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-qyt8byl","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-5b8429c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-5b8429c","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为黑三棱科植物黑三棱、细叶黑三棱、小黑三棱的块茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-iwkj0p7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-iwkj0p7","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.SparganiumstoloniferumBuch.-Ham2.SparganiumstenophyllumMaxim3.SparganiumsimplexHuds."}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-7g7xju4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-7g7xju4","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋、冬二季均可采收，挖取块茎后，去掉茎叶及须根，洗净，削去外皮，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-qemz9q3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-qemz9q3","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-itwmvn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-itwmvn3","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.黑三棱，多年生草本，高50-100cm。根茎横走，下生粗而短的块茎。茎直立，圆柱形，光滑。叶丛生，2列；叶片线形，长60-95cm，宽约2cm，先端渐失，基部拖茎，下面具1条纵校。花茎由叶丛中抽出，单一，有时分枝；花单性，雌雄同株，集成头状花序，有叶状苞片；雄花序位于雌花序的上部，直径约10mm，通常2-10个；雌花序直径12mm以上，通常1-3个；雄花花被片3-4，倒披外形，雄蕊3；雌花有雌蕊1，罕为2，子房纺锤形，花柱长，柱头狭披针形。聚花果直径约2cm，核果倒卵状圆锥形，长6-10mm，径4-5mm，先端有锐尖头，花被宿存。花期6-7月，果期7-8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-uhkw2cv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-uhkw2cv","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于池沼或水沟等处。分布于东北、华北、华东。西南及陕西、宁夏、甘肃、河南、湖北、湖南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-sdpx1si","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-sdpx1si","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.细叶黑，本种与黑三陵的主要区别在于：植株较矮小，根茎短，块茎较小，茎直立，纤细、叶片决条形，长达65cm，宽2.5-4mm，中脉明显雌花序1-2（-3）个，无模，球形，直径约8mm，雌花密集，花被叶膜质，倒卵形或狭倒卵形，长1.5-2.5mm，雌蕊长约3.5mm，子房狭长，上部变细成花注，柱头狭长圆形；雄花序通常7个左右，本月茎或分校预部，谁花密集，花被片3，膜质，狭匙形或匙状条形术1.5-2mm，雄蕊3，长2-3mm，有长花丝。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-7ohx6y8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-7ohx6y8","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.小黑三棱，本种与前两种的主要区别在于：茎不分校，通常无根茎，块望较小。叶片狭条形，长达60cm，宽5-8mm，中脉明显。雌花序2-4（-6）个，最卜面的1-2个有便，球形，直径约8mm，雌花密储，花被片3-4，狭匙形，有不整齐小齿，雌蕊纹外向锤形，长约5mm，花柱长约2mm，柱头钻形；雄蕴含序5-7个，雄花密集，花被片膜质，近狭条表，长约3mm，雄花长达5mm。聚花果直径约1.5cm；果实纺锤形，先端渐狭，有宿存花被片。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-puci65j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-puci65j","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，在吉林、安徽和江苏等省的个别地区用莎草科植物荆三棱ScirpusyagaraOhwi的块茎作三棱商品收购。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-c8izau4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-c8izau4","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-81mvz2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-81mvz2f","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：1.生于池沼或水沟等处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-tgg9l8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-tgg9l8w","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生于沼泽地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-1ugyzt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-1ugyzt9","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.生于池沼及水沟等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-axwx9pk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-axwx9pk","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于东北、华北、华东、西南及陕西、宁夏、甘肃、河南、湖北、湖南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-disqz1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-disqz1o","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于东北，河北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-uk86uav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-uk86uav","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.分布于东北各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-cb0q80d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-cb0q80d","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-xum7ht5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-xum7ht5","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性善喜暖湿润气候，宜在向阳、低湿的环境中生长。对土壤要求不严，可栽种在沟渠、池塘的浅水处，也可栽在水田里。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-fc1di7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-fc1di7v","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术用块茎繁殖。冬季收获的块茎，放于客中贮藏，翌春用贮存的块茎或临时挖取的块茎为繁殖材料，按30cm开穴、深约10cm，每穴平放块茎2-3个，栽后浇灌清水，经常保持有水。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-ihwynx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-ihwynx6","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理苗出齐后，须经常拔除杂草；生长期中追肥2次，夯苗后追肥1次，以人畜粪水为主，也可施用硫酸按，5-6月进行第2次追肥，先撤施草木灰或圈肥及过磷酸钙，施后中耕薅到土里，并实行浅水灌溉，切忌断水干旱。冬季苗枯时收获，割去枯残茎叶，挖取块茎，洗净，晒至八成平时，放入竹笼里，撞去须根和粗皮，或削去外皮，晒或炕至全干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-hg32sy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-hg32sy3","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-h3ze2l0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-h3ze2l0","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）黑三棱块茎圆锥形或倒卵形，略扁，上圆下尖，下端稍弯曲，长2-10Cm，直径2-4Cm。表面黄白色或灰黄色，有刀削痕，顶端有茎痕；须根痕点状，略呈横向环状排列，两侧的须根浪较粗。体重，质坚实，难碎断，入水下沉。碎断面灰黄色或浅棕色，稍平坦，有多数散在的小点及条状根纹。气微，嚼之略苦涩、微麻辣。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-lorvand","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-lorvand","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以体重、质坚实、黄白色者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-jw917nr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-jw917nr","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）细叶黑三棱本品与黑三棱相似，推块茎较小。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-xcaqz7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-xcaqz7k","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）小黑三校本品与黑三棱相似，但块茎较小。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-xqhvbku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-xqhvbku","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别黑三陵，块茎横切面：残存的皮层为通气组织，有较大的细胞间隙，内皮层为1列切向延长的细胞，有的细胞内壁及侧壁增厚。中柱薄壁细胞类多角形，壁略厚，维管束周木型或外韧型，星散排列，外有维管束鞘纤维、导管及纤维非木化。薄壁细胞间散有多数分泌细胞。薄壁细胞含有多数淀粉粒。在残存的皮层细胞中偶见草酸钙簇晶。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-7br0ahk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-7br0ahk","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-78kzcrq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-78kzcrq","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黑三棱，块茎含挥发油，其中主要成分为苯乙醇(benzeneethanol)，对苯二酚(1,4-benzenediol)，十六酸(hexadecanoicacid)，还有去氢木香内酯(dehydrocostuslactone)，3，4-二氢-8-羟基-3-甲基-1H2-苯并吡喃-4-酮(3,4-dihydro-8-hydroxy-3-methyl-1H-2-benzopyran-4-one)，1-羟基-2-乙酰基-4-甲基苯(1-hydroxy-2-acetyl-4-methylbenzene)，β榄香烯(β-elemene)，2-呋喃醇(2-furanmethanol)，2-乙酰基吡咯(2-acetylpyrrole)等共21个成分。又含多种有机酸：琥珀酸(succinicacid)，三棱酸(sanlengacid)，9-11-十八碳二烯酸(9-11-octadedicenoicacid)，9-12-十八碳二烯酸(9-12-octadedicenoicacid)，10-十九烯酸(10-nonadecenoicacid)，11-二十烯酸(11-eicosenoicacid)，苯甲酸(benzoicacid)，3-苯-2-丙烯酸(3-phenyl-2-propenoicacid)，壬二酸(azelaicacid)，癸二酸(decanedioicacid)以及含有C8-C10、C12、C14-C20的脂肪酸。还含刺芒柄花素(formonetin)，豆甾醇(stigmasterol)，β-谷甾醇(β-sitosterol)，胡萝卜甙(daucosterol)。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-jfmwtz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-jfmwtz7","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.小黑三棱，叶、根含生物碱；地上茎含维生素C。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-03b2fd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-03b2fd6","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-tia8um5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-tia8um5","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.对家兔离体小肠运动的影响三棱水煎者沸30min，制成含生药75%的煎剂，在100ml保养液中加入三棱煎剂0.2ml，观察对离体肠管的影响，实验重复8次，结果表明，三棱可引起肠管收缩加强，紧张性升高，但其作用可被不同浓度的阿托品所拮抗。对离体兔子宫也有兴奋作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-yurug1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-yurug1h","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.对大白鼠血液凝固的影响大鼠体重200±50g左右，禁食（不禁水）14-15小时，ig三棱煎剂6-8ml，连续2次，间隔1.5小时，总量相当中药15-20g，给药后1.5h，麻醉后自颈总动脉放血。对照组用自来水。观察药物对体外血栓形成的时间，长度，重量，血小板计数和聚集功能，凝血酶原时间，白陶土部分凝血活酶时间，血浆纤维蛋白原以及优球蛋白溶解时间的影响，结果见表1-4。有报道用小鼠做三棱的活血作用，结果表明三棱水煎剂ig给药（每只相当生药10g），有抑制血小板聚集、延长血栓形成时间、缩短血栓，长度和减轻重量的作用，还有延长凝血酶原时间及部分凝血致活酶的趋势，降低全血粘度。其结果对传统的活血化瘀药提供了理论依据。实验中还发现荆三棱（Scirpusyagara）的抑制血栓形成，降低全血粘度的作用强于本品，对血小板聚集功能的抑制作用，则本品强于荆三棱。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-03zlkbs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-03zlkbs","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【毒性】本品水煎剂（4g生药/ml）ig给药,NIH小鼠10只，剂量480g生药/kg，连续7日，ig后活动减少，静卧不动，d2恢复正常，未见死亡；ig给药，观察7d，LD50为233.3±9.9g生药/kg。死亡前出现短暂的抽搐、惊跳、呼吸抑制而死亡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-y26rod0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-y26rod0","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】三棱：拣净杂质，用水浸泡，捞出润透，切片，晒干。醋三棱：取净三棱置开水锅内浸没，煮至五、六成透时，加醋再煮至八成透，停止加水，并停止续火，留在锅内闷透，吸尽余汤，捞出，晾至外皮无水分，切片，晒干。（每三棱100斤，用醋30斤）。麸炒制：取麦麸炒至冒烟时，加入三棱片，炒至黄色，筛去麦麸。每三棱片10公斤，用麦麸1公斤。酒麸制：麦麸炒热，再加经水、酒闷4小时的三棱片，炒至黄色，筛去麦麸。每三棱片10公斤，用酒、麦麸、水各0、5公斤。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-uv2vov1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-uv2vov1","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味辛；涩；凉"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-18g945m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-18g945m","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肝；脾经"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-e5ncecb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-e5ncecb","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】破血行气；消积止痛。主症瘕痞块；瘀滞经闭；痛经；食积胀痛；跌年伤痛"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-wtka9a5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-wtka9a5","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，5-10g；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-37akucc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-37akucc","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】气虚体弱，血枯经闭及孕妇忌服。《医学启源》：破气损真，气虚人不用。《品汇精要》：妊娠不可服。《得配本草》：素有血症者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-31o25om","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-31o25om","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-uugxlx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-uugxlx5","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.王好古：三棱，破血中之气，肝经血分药也。三棱、莪术治积块疮硬者，乃坚者削之也。......通肝经积血。治疮肿坚硬。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-j62xz1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-j62xz1p","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：三棱能破气散结，故能治诸病，其功可近于香附而力峻，故难久服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-dwamkv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-dwamkv8","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《医学衷中参西录》：三棱气味俱淡，微有辛意；莪术味微苦，气微香，亦微有辛意，性皆微温，为化瘀血之要药。以治男子痃癖，女子症瘕，月经不通，性非猛烈而建功甚速。其行气之力，又能治心腹疼痛、胁下胀疼，一切血凝气滞之症。若与参、术、芪诸药并用，大能开胃进食，调血和血。若细核二药之区别，化血之力三棱优于莪术，理气之力莪术优于三棱。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-v0995sv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-v0995sv","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《日华子本草》：治妇人血脉不调，心腹痛，落胎，消恶血，补劳，通月经，治气胀，消扑损瘀血，产后腹痛、血运并宿血不下。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-8dpnwmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-8dpnwmg","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《开宝本草》：主老癖症瘕结块。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-lx9gvrv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-lx9gvrv","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《医学启源》：主心膈痛，饮食不消，破气。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-x63341z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-x63341z","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草经疏》：三棱，从血药则治血，从气药则治气。老癖症瘕积聚结块，未有不由血瘀、气结、食停所致，苦能泄而辛能散，甘能和而入脾，血属阴而有形，此所以能治一切凝结停滞有形之坚积也。洁古谓其能泻真气，真气虚者勿用，此见谛之言也。故凡用以消导，必资人参、芍药、地黄之力，而后可以无弊，观东垣五积方皆有人参，意可知矣。何者？盖积聚症瘕，必由元气不足，不能运化流行致之，欲其消也，必借脾胃气旺，能渐渐消磨开散，以收平复之功，如只一味专用克消，则脾胃之气愈弱，后天之气益亏，将见故者不去，新者复至矣。戒之哉。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-y364ztv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-y364ztv","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本草图经》：今三棱荆、湘、江、淮水泽之间皆有。叶如莎草，极长，茎三棱如削，大如人指，高五、六尺，茎端开花，大体皆如莎草而大，生水际及浅水中，苗下即魁，其旁有根横贯，一根则连数魁，魁上发苗，采时断其苗及横根。形扁如鲫鱼者，三棱也；根末将尽一魁，未发苗，小圆如乌梅者，黑三棱也；又根之端，钩屈如爪者，为鸡爪三棱，皆皮黑肌白而至轻。三者本一物，但力有刚柔，各适其用，因其形为名，如乌头、乌喙，云母、云华之类，本非两物也。今人乃妄以凫茨、香附子为之。又《本草》谓京三棱形如鲫鱼，黑三棱形如乌梅而轻，今红蒲根至坚重，刻削而成，莫知形体，又叶扁茎圆，不复有三棱处，不知何缘名三棱也。今三棱皆独旁引二根，无直下根，其形大体多亦如鲫鱼。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103112-dabl2xo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103112-dabl2xo","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830103113-458dbqv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830103113-458dbqv","updated":"20240830103201"}},{"ID":"20240830103126-0kr8uaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-0kr8uaa","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：黑三棱"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-2p9r6c3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-2p9r6c3","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黑三棱《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-x4w1s47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-x4w1s47","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HēiSānLénɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-zojogz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-zojogz2","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】京三棱、草三棱、鸡爪棱、黑三棱、石三棱"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-p5nfxz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-p5nfxz8","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为黑三棱科植物黑三棱的干燥块茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-ucd99t7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-ucd99t7","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-nrfnsgk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-nrfnsgk","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-lnod2sq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-lnod2sq","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、症瘕鼓胀，用三棱根切一石，加水五石煮成三石，去渣，再煮，得汁三培。隔水明显成膏，浓如稠糖。每天早晨服一小匙，酒送下。又方：荆三棱、青皮、陈皮、木香各半两，肉豆蔻、槟榔各一两，硇砂二钱，共研为末，加糊成丸子，如梧子大，每服三十丸，姜汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-9e16m76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-9e16m76","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、痃癖（胁下坚块如石）。用荆三棱（炮）一两、川大黄一两，共研为末，加醋熬成膏。每日服一匙，空心服，生姜、桔皮汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-e30kzhj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-e30kzhj","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、小儿气癖。用三棱煮汁给授乳的母亲吃，也把少量给小儿吃。小儿新生百日及十岁以下，无论热痃癖等，服此药都有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-8k2u5d6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-8k2u5d6","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、反胃恶心，药食不下。用荆三棱（炮）一两、生丁香三分，共研为末。每服一钱，开水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-eg9nk9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-eg9nk9n","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、乳汁不下。用荆三棱三个，加水二碗，煎成一碗，洗奶（乳房），取汁出为度。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-i6w716e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-i6w716e","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、浑身燎泡（状如棠梨，每泡出水）。用荆三棱、蓬莪茂各五两，共研为末。分三次服，酒调下。连续服完。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-27zjbn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-27zjbn5","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-wdbd5mu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-wdbd5mu","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黑三棱《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-wm1oe8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-wm1oe8c","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-183hlfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-183hlfd","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三棱始载于《本草拾遗》，涉及的种类较多。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-isezp2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-isezp2p","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《开宝本草》所谓形如鲫鱼而体重的为“京三棱”，是指黑三棱科植物；而所谓形如乌梅而体轻的“黑三棱”，却是指莎草科植物（ScirpusyagaraOhwi）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-wpyzkwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-wpyzkwh","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》云：“三棱多生荒废陂池湿地，春时丛生，夏秋抽高茎，茎端复生数叶，开花六七枝，花皆细碎成穗，黄紫色，中有细子。其叶茎花实俱有三棱。”所指及附图均为本种。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-rwt67tw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-rwt67tw","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HēiSānLénɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-sgwb20v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-sgwb20v","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】三棱、泡三棱。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-pl37w49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-pl37w49","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-rqkzyl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-rqkzyl2","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为莎草科植物荆三棱的块茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-8l93cvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-8l93cvv","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：ScirpusyagaraOhwi[ScirpusmaritimusC.B.Clarke]"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-7shiwlk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-7shiwlk","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季采挖，除去根茎及须根，洗净，或削去外皮晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-yw7yd6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-yw7yd6m","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】荆三棱，多年生草本，高70-120cm。匍匐根茎粗而长，顶端生球状快蔓。秆高大，粗壮，锐三棱形。叶秆生；叶片线形，长20-40cm，宽5-10mm，稍坚挺，叶鞘长达20cm。叶状苞片3-5，长于花序；聚伞花序不分枝；小穗卵状长圆形，锈褐色，长10-18mm，宽5-8mm，密生多数花；鳞片长圆形，长约8mm，有1脉，背面上部有短柔毛，先端略有撕裂状缺刻，有长2-3mm的芒；下位刚毛6，几与小坚果等长，有倒刺；雄蕊3，花药线形，长约4mm；花柱细长，柱头3，少为2。小坚果三棱状倒卵形，长约3mm，熟时黄白色或黄褐色，表面有细网纹。花、果期5-7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-l3cwzlc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-l3cwzlc","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-lp6dctq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-lp6dctq","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于湖、河浅水中和水湿地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-5xc5jmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-5xc5jmo","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于东北、华北、华东、西南及陕西、甘肃、青海、新疆、河南、湖北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-ncjvp7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-ncjvp7p","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-293tn6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-293tn6d","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.性状鉴别：块茎呈近球形，长2-3.5cm，直径2-3cm，表面棕黑色，凹凸不平，有少数点状须根痕；去外皮者下端略呈锥形，黄白色或灰白色，有残存的根茎疤痕及未去净的外皮黑斑，并有刀削痕。质轻而坚硬，难折断，入水中漂浮于水面，稀下沉。碎断面平坦，黄白色或棕黄色。气微，味淡，嚼之微辛、涩。以个大、坚实者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-mhagtci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-mhagtci","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.显微鉴别：2.1.块茎横切面：皮层为通气组织，多被削去，偶有残存。近内皮层外侧有2-3层厚壁细胞环带，棕色或暗棕色，细胞壁木化。内皮层细胞增厚呈马蹄形。中柱鞘纤维1列或成束与小型维管束相间排列，中柱薄壁细胞类多角形，含微小的淀粉粒，直径不及lμm，维管束周木型或外韧型，在薄壁组织中散有分泌细胞。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-w6rtprs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-w6rtprs","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.粉末特征：灰棕色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-usppoku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-usppoku","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.1.厚壁细胞单个散在、两个并列或成片，黄棕色、绿棕色、黄绿色或淡黄色，多呈长条形，少数类圆形或长圆形，边缘多不规则波状凹凸或有短分枝，有的较平整，长15-216μm，直径7-34μm，壁厚4-16μm，非木化或微木化，纹孔细小，孔沟短而密，壁极厚者胞腔不明显。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-6gm27no","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-6gm27no","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.2.木化薄壁细胞呈类长方形或长椭圆形，两端平钝或斜尖，长77-125μm，直径14-32μm，壁厚4-7μm，连珠状。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-dsh2508","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-dsh2508","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.3.导管傍薄壁细胞呈长条形，长18-180μm，直径5-18μm，壁厚2-4μm，连珠状，微木化。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-kq2uiky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-kq2uiky","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.4.分泌细胞呈类圆形，直径23-36μm，壁稍厚，内含棕色物。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-3dkwa1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-3dkwa1w","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.5.薄壁细胞呈多角形或类圆形，直径22-81μm，壁厚2-5μm，非木化，有的可见纹孔及孔沟。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-855pw7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-855pw7e","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.6.木纤维多成束，黄色，细长，末端渐尖，长72-288μm，直径7-18μm，壁厚3-5μm，微木化，孔沟较稀疏。另可见内皮层细胞和梯纹、网纹导管。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-vvagrhl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-vvagrhl","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】含白桦脂醇(betulin)和甘露醇(mannitol)。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-n91a43j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-n91a43j","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味辛；苦；性平"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-jw5o8d6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-jw5o8d6","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肝；脾经"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-s824o53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-s824o53","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛瘀通经；破血消症；行气消积。主血滞经闭；痛经；产后瘀阻腹痛；跌打瘀肿；腹中包块；食积腹痛"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-u46sr6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-u46sr6g","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，4.5-9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-ffzactf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-ffzactf","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-n88q58l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-n88q58l","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"体虚、血枯经闭及孕妇禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-h9afazs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-h9afazs","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《陕甘宁青中草药选》：“脾虚无瘀滞者忌用，孕妇禁用。”2.南药《中草药学》：“体虚者忌用。”"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-58uel5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-58uel5k","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】论黑三棱功用特点了：李时珍：“三棱能破气散结，故能治诸病。其功可近于香附而力峻，故难久服。按戴原礼《证治要诀》云：有人病症癖腹胀，用三棱、莪茂，以酒偎煎服之，下一黑物如鱼而愈也。”(《纲目》)"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-8ohoku4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-8ohoku4","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】【集解】1.《本草图，经》：“今三棱，荆湘江淮水泽之间皆有。叶如莎草，极长，茎三棱如削，大如人指，高五六尺，茎端开花，大体皆如莎草而大，生水际及浅水中。苗下即魁，其傍有根横贯，一根则连数魁，魁上发苗。采时断其苗及横根，形扁长如鲫鱼者，三棱也。根末将尽，一魁末发苗，小圆如乌梅者，黑三棱也。又根之端钩屈如爪者，为鸡爪三棱。皆皮黑肌白而至轻。三者本一物，但力有刚柔，各适其用。因其形为名，如乌头、乌喙，云母、云华之类，本非两物也。今人乃妄以凫茨、香附子为之。又本草谓京三棱，形如鲫鱼，黑三棱形如乌梅而轻。今红蒲根至坚重，刻削而成莫知形体，又叶扁茎圆，不复有三棱处，不知何缘名三棱也。今三棱皆独傍引二根，无直下很。其形大体多亦如鲫鱼。”2.《救荒本草》：“黑三棱，旧云河、陕、江、淮、荆、襄间皆有之。今郑州贾峪山洞水边亦有。苗高三四尺，叶似菖蒲叶而厚大，背皆三棱剑脊，叶中撺葶，葶上结实，攒为刺球，状如楮挑样而尖，颗瓣甚多。其颗瓣形似草决明子而大，生则青，熟则红黄色。根状如乌海而颇大，有须，蔓延相连，比京三棱体微轻。其葶味甜，根味苦，采嫩葶剥去粗皮、渫熟。油盐调食。”"}]},{"ID":"20240830103126-bdmanm1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103126-bdmanm1","updated":"20240830103201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830103128-7bua5t0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830103128-7bua5t0","updated":"20240830103201"}},{"ID":"20240830103129-klv3vtj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830103129-klv3vtj","updated":"20240830103201"}}]}